<title>UK: LME details settlements for copper/aluminium TAPOs.</title>
<headline>LME details settlements for copper/aluminium TAPOs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said that its monthly average settlement prices for Copper and Aluminium TAPOs were $2,405.85 and $1,580.43 a tonne respectively for February.</p>
<p>The LME introduced traded average price options earlier this year. These are settled in cash, while traded options have physical delivery.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
